                                "sense_id": "5080c744-8605-3882-8e31-6276fd0e077a",
                                "text": "De godsdienstigheden van het dorp zijn diepgeworteld.",
                                "translation": "The devoutness of the village is deeply rooted.",
                                "english": "The devoutness of the village is deeply rooted."
                            },
                            {
